入组条件:
Inclusion Criteria:

Patients must meet all of the following criteria to be eligible for enrollment in this study:

1. Voluntary participation in the study and provision of signed and dated informed consent;
2. Aged 18 to 75 years (inclusive) at the time of signing informed consent;
3. Patients with distant metastasis or unresectable locally advanced colorectal cancer who have disease progression or intolerable toxicities after previous standard treatment must include oxaliplatin, irinotecan and fluorouracil-based drugs in previous standard treatment regimen;
